OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI promises to pursue any leads 
OL,4,Auncovered during Pat Finucane inquiry  
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland 
OL,7,F(PSNI) has promised to pursue any      
OL,8,Finvestigative leads which might be     
OL,9,Funcovered by the public inquiry into   
OL,10,Fthe murder of Pat Finucane.            
OL,12,FFinucane, 39, was shot at his home in  
OL,13,Fnorth Belfast by the Ulster Defence    
OL,14,FAssociation (UDA) in front of his wife 
OL,15,Fand children in February 1989.         
OL,17,FMartin Wolfe KC, a lawyer acting for   
OL,18,Fthe PSNI at the inquiry said it "has no
OL,19,Fappetite to stifle or restrain any     
OL,20,Finvestigation directed to uncover the  
OL,21,Ftruth".                                
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
