OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI promises to pursue any leads 
OL,4,Auncovered during Pat Finucane inquiry  
OL,6,FGeraldine Finucane said the commitment 
OL,7,Fof the PSNI "being so willing to       
OL,8,Fparticipate and help the inquiry was   
OL,9,Fvery, very welcome from our point of   
OL,10,Fview".                                 
